### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### Fetch all lobbies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/ HTTP/1.1
### Fetch all lobbies with members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies?relations=members HTTP/1.1
### Test Case: Create a new lobby with romantic match type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "name": "Serata Romantica Milano",
    "location": {
        "lat": 45.4642,
        "lng": 9.1900
    },
    "matchType": "romantic",
    "eventType": "couple",
    "maxMembers": 2,
    "description": "Una serata romantica nel cuore di Milano",
    "creationDate": "2024-03-20T18:00:00.000Z",
    "preEventDate": "2024-03-20T18:00:00.000Z",
    "eventDate": "2024-03-20T20:00:00.000Z",
    "postEventDate": "2024-03-20T23:00:00.000Z",
    "inviteLink": "https://example.com/invite/milano-romantic",
    "questionSet": "3938b805-10d3-46eb-b4de-6e33e575bfec"
}

### Remove a lobby
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v0/collections/lobbies/367f4c53-66dd-4cee-a856-c6bc3abdbc69 HTTP/1.1